    "notes": "Inspected all 27 current medium-fi frames: street, block and skyline ranges beside procedural buildings at noon and late afternoon, Economy and High, untextured silhouette, six architectural details, four whole-temple levels and all transitions. The standard context camera scale was widened to 2.2 so procedural neighbors remain visible at street range. Skyline 972 triangles preserves the compound and clustered tower mass; district 3890 adds coarse mapped faces and sparse colonnades; street 15720 adds open portals, selected facial shape and grouped bays; closeup 42784 refines the faces and stepped lotus crowns. Initial skyline plus district geometry is 494096 bytes, plus three shared material graphs. Separate attribute streams prevent duplicate GPU uploads. Close-range shape changes between coarse and detailed face/crown levels remain visible; physical-device and dense-city measurements are pending.",
